* Without any systematic anti-tumor treatment;
* ECOG 0-1;
* ANC≥ 1.5×109/L;
* PLT≥ 75×109/L;
* HB≥ 8.0 g/dL;
* TBIL ≤ 1.5´ ULN;
* ALT and AST ≤ 2.5´ULN;
* Cr ≤ 1.5´ULN or CCr ≥ 60ml/min;
* Urine protein \< +, if urine protein + then the total protein in 24 hours must be \<500mg;
